    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe the content like this:<br><br><i>This game lets you jump right in\u2014no grinding required! Think you\u2019ve got the reflexes? Spot the projectiles, dodge like a pro, and rack up the highest score!</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.poster.avif?t=1750114652\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.webm?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.mp4?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No In-App Purchases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.poster.avif?t=1750114652\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.webm?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.mp4?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe the content like this:<br><br><i>This game lets you jump right in\u2014no grinding required! Think you\u2019ve got the reflexes? Spot the projectiles, dodge like a pro, and rack up the highest score!</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.poster.avif?t=1750114652\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.webm?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/c1fa797e0e5c2b003c739819b1213f88.mp4?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No In-App Purchases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.poster.avif?t=1750114652\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.webm?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589920/extras/b1e6567d75cc8db2f4f740dd90487df8.mp4?t=1750114652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Last longer, dodge arrows, turn on those lights. One Fool\u2019s Move is a challenging game you can jump into right away. It\u2019s a bullet-hell game, but instead of upgrades, you\u2019ll have to rely on pure skill.",
